---

<BaseLayout
  title={"Business Network & Wi-Fi Services in Austin | Bleufoot"}
  description={"Business network services in Austin, including firewalls, switching, VLANs, Wi-Fi, VPN access, structured cabling, cleanup, and network monitoring."}
  canonical={"https://www.bleufoot.com/network-services"}
  robots={"index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1"}
  activePage="services"
  openGraph={{"title": "Business Network & Wi-Fi Services in Austin | Bleufoot", "description": "Business network services including firewalls, switching, VLANs, Wi-Fi, VPN access, structured cabling, and monitoring.", "url": "https://www.bleufoot.com/network-services", "image": "https://www.bleufoot.com/assets/img/og-image.png", "imageType": "image/png", "imageWidth": "1200", "imageHeight": "630", "imageAlt": "Bleufoot Solutions technology services"}}
  structuredData={structuredData}
>
<main>
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container page-hero-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow"><h4>Network Services</h4></div><h1>Business networks that are secure, reliable, and built to scale.</h1><p>Your network connects employees, devices, applications, cloud services, phones, security systems, and business operations. It needs to be designed and managed with intention.</p></div><div class="hero-panel"><ul><li>Firewall management</li><li>Switching and VLANs</li><li>Business Wi‑Fi</li><li>VPN and remote access</li></ul></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="kicker"><h4>Connectivity with structure</h4></div><h2>Reliable networks start with clear design and ongoing visibility.</h2></div><p>Bleufoot helps businesses reduce disruption, strengthen security, improve coverage, and support the way teams actually work.</p></div>
<div class="grid grid-3">
<div class="card"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-5"></path></svg></span><h3>Firewall Management</h3><p>Firewall configuration, access rules, VPN settings, segmentation, and practical security controls.</p></div>
<div class="card"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="5" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="5" cy="19" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="19" cy="19" r="2.5"></circle><path d="M10.8 7.2L6.2 16.8M13.2 7.2l4.6 9.6M7.5 19h9"></path></svg></span><h3>Switching &amp; Segmentation</h3><p>Managed switching, VLAN design, device segmentation, and organized connectivity for business environments.</p></div>
<div class="card"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12.5a10 10 0 0 1 14 0"></path><path d="M8.5 16a5 5 0 0 1 7 0"></path><path d="M12 20h.01"></path></svg></span><h3>Wireless Design</h3><p>Wi‑Fi planning, coverage improvement, guest networks, access point placement, and performance troubleshooting.</p></div>
<div class="card"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17.5 19H8a5 5 0 1 1 1.1-9.9A6 6 0 0 1 20 12.5 3.5 3.5 0 0 1 17.5 19z"></path></svg></span><h3>VPN &amp; Remote Access</h3><p>Secure remote access and site connectivity designed around business needs and risk reduction.</p></div>
<div class="card"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.7 6.3a4 4 0 0 0-5 5L3 18v3h3l6.7-6.7a4 4 0 0 0 5-5l-2.4 2.4-2.8-2.8 2.2-2.6z"></path></svg></span><h3>Cabling &amp; Cleanup</h3><p>Structured cabling coordination, rack organization, labeling, and documentation to make networks easier to support.</p></div>
<div class="card"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 7v6l4 2"></path></svg></span><h3>Network Monitoring</h3><p>Visibility into device health, performance, uptime, and connectivity before issues become business disruptions.</p></div>
</div></div></section>
<section class="cta-band">
<div class="container">
<div class="kicker">
<h4>Strengthen the connections your business depends on</h4>
</div>
<h2>
      Build a network that is reliable, secure, and easier to support.
    </h2>
<p>
      Whether you are troubleshooting unreliable connectivity,
      improving Wi-Fi coverage, replacing aging equipment, securing
      remote access, organizing cabling, or adding network monitoring,
      Bleufoot can help you determine the right next step.
    </p>
<div class="hero-actions">
<a class="btn btn-light" href="/quote-request?service=Network%20Services">
  Discuss Your Network Needs →
</a>
<a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/contact">
        Ask a Network Question
      </a>
</div>
</div>
</section>
